9x2=18, 4x2=8, 7x5=35, 4x10=40, 3x5=15"}], "maxDicePerLine": null, "longTextFontSize": null}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 161927711, "text": "Stick figures drawn around the number facts 3x4 4x3 12/3 and 12/4", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 1, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": "Year 2 fact family", "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": "Year 2 fact family-G4MGeQ5edBj7Xd6l1UP_W.png", "linkName": null, "stepType": "IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 143388537, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 143388977, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 5, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 143388537, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<h2><strong>Extra Challenge:</strong></h2>\n<p>Roll the dice above and see how quickly you can write down all four facts.</p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 161928265, "text": "A Note on Fact Families", "modal": {"steps": [{"id": 161928127, "text": null, "order": 1, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "modalId": 262, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": 0, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": null, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<ul>\n<li><strong>Multiplication is commutative</strong>. It can be done in any order.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>3 x 4 and 4 x 3 give the same answer.</p>\n<p></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Division is not commutativ</strong>e.  The order does matter</li>\n</ul>\n<p>12  ÷  4 is not the same as 4 <span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">÷</span> 12.</p>\n<p></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Some children may find this confusing.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A common misunderstanding is to think the numbers can go in any place.</p>\n<p>Children may write a sum like 3 <span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">÷</span>  12 = 4</p>\n<p></p>\n<ul>\n<li>It can help to talk about 'the whole'.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>The whole </strong>is the answer when you multiply.</p>\n<p>Always start with<strong> the whole </strong>when you divide.</p>\n<p></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Lots of practice with real objects can help.</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;\"></p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}], "details": {"id": 262, "name": "A Note on Fact Families", "logCreatedAt": "2023-10-10T09:07:32.84555", "logUpdatedAt": "2023-10-10T09:07:32.84555", "logCreatedById": 108180408, "logUpdatedById": 108180408, "nameForContentDev": null}}, "order": 4, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "MODAL", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 143388537, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 262, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}]